"            <li><span class='improved-badge'>优化</span> 🎨 <b>界面美化</b> - 圆角表格、悬停效果，图标全面替换为 emoji</li>"
"            <li><span class='improved-badge'>优化</span> ⚡ <b>性能提升</b> - 优化 DNS 缓存，改进异常处理</li>"
"            <li><span class='improved-badge'>优化</span> 🌐 <b>GeoIP 自动启用</b> - 无需额外配置即可识别访客国家</li>"
"            <li><span class='improved-badge'>优化</span> 📡 <b>IPv6 支持</b> - 增强对 IPv6 和 CloudFlare 真实 IP 的支持</li>"
"        </ul>"
"        <div class='whatsnew-footer'>"
"            <a href='awstats_changelog.html' class='button button-text'>查看完整更新历史 →</a>"
"        </div>"
"    </div>"
""
