"            <div class='technical-item'>"
"                <div class='technical-check'>📈</div>"
"                <div class='technical-text'><b>可扩展</b> - 插件架构设计，可根据需求灵活扩展功能</div>"
"            </div>"
"            <div class='technical-item'>"
