"                <div class='technical-check'>🔄</div>"
"                <div class='technical-text'><b>灵活的更新方式</b> - 支持命令行和 CGI 两种模式，可集成到各种自动化流程中</div>"
"            </div>"
"        </div>"
"    </div>"
""
"    <!-- ==================== Usage Statistics ==================== -->"
"    <div class='stats-section'>"
"        <h2 class='section-title'>📈 适合各种规模的网站</h2>"
"        <div class='stats-grid'>"
"            <div class='stat-card'>"
