"            </div>"
"        </div>"
"    </div>"
""
"    <!-- ==================== Call to Action ==================== -->"
"    <div class='cta-section'>"
"        <h2 class='cta-title'>开始使用 AWStats</h2>"
"        <p class='cta-desc'>开源免费，立即下载，几分钟内即可完成安装配置</p>"
"        <div class='cta-buttons'>"
